viewers (on both this PR and the prerequisite PRs).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764731994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814420111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750#issuecomment-2814420111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98750","id":2814420111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nwKSP","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T03:12:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T03:17:31Z","body":"@Calinou That's expected because those properties are 32-bit floats, but Variant only holds 64-bit floats. If we wanted to fix this I suppose we would need to distinguish those cases.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814420111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815593033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750#issuecomment-2815593033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98750","id":2815593033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n0opJ","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T14:53:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T14:16:43Z","body":"@Calinou I thought of a solution, it's a tiny bit of a hack but I think it's a good idea. See `// Hack to avoid garbage digits`\r\n* In 100% of cases, the serialized value is more precise than master.\r\n* In 100% of cases when the backing field is 32-bit floats, the serialized value exactly matches the in-memory value. (excluding the intentional NaN and negative zero collapsing)\r\n* For almost all cases when the backing field is 64-bit floats, the serialized value exactly matches.\r\n  * One in 2^29 cases will be off by a factor of up to 2^-23, which is better than the current master when every case is off by a factor of up to 2^-20.\r\n  * Arguably, even in those rare cases, it's the preferred behavior to write the simplified version.\r\n* Does not produce undesired diffs anymore when using **Tools > Upgrade Project Files....** on the 3D platformer demo. It does still produce some diffs, but only desired diffs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815593033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880110058","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750#issuecomment-2880110058","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98750","id":2880110058,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rqv3q","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T12:47:29Z","u